            -- auto_shovel_fruit.lua
-- Auto Shovel Fruit: Remove_Item is 1-at-a-time on the server (same-frame 1/12).
-- Fast path: fire → wait gone → 0.52s cooldown (6/6 in ~4s). No parallel.

